{
  "sourceCommit": "8d9011da395faf8415d555447c1472c3b485bf2e",
  "html": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">MageOS UIkit Theme Module</h1><a id=\"user-content-mageos-uikit-theme-module\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: MageOS UIkit Theme Module\" href=\"#mageos-uikit-theme-module\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Set of utilities for the Mage-OS/Magento UIkit theme</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See also <a href=\"https://github.com/mage-os-lab/theme-frontend-uikit\">mage-os-lab/theme-frontend-uikit</a></p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Overview</h2><a id=\"user-content-overview\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Overview\" href=\"#overview\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <strong>UIkit Theme</strong> module allows svg assets compilation inside static contents, removes unused css UIkit3 classes ( \"uk-\" prefixed classes) and preload fonts.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">How it works</h2><a id=\"user-content-how-it-works\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: How it works\" href=\"#how-it-works\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Fonts preload</h3><a id=\"user-content-fonts-preload\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Fonts preload\" href=\"#fonts-preload\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Use \"head.asset.preload\" layout block to preload fonts and assets inside default_head_blocks.xml files</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"...\n&lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;referenceBlock name=&quot;head.asset.preload&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;arguments&gt;\n            &lt;argument name=&quot;assets&quot; xsi:type=&quot;array&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;item name=&quot;uikit-icons&quot; xsi:type=&quot;array&quot;&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=&quot;path&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;js/uikit/uikit-icons.min.js&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=&quot;type&quot; xsi:type=&quot;array&quot;&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=&quot;name&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;type&lt;/item&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=&quot;value&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;script&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=&quot;crossorigin&quot; xsi:type=&quot;array&quot;&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=&quot;name&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;crossorigin&lt;/item&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=&quot;value&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;false&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;/item&gt;\n                &lt;/item&gt;\n                &lt;item name=&quot;montserrat-light&quot; xsi:type=&quot;array&quot;&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=&quot;path&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;fonts/Montserrat/Montserrat-Light.woff2&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=&quot;type&quot; xsi:type=&quot;array&quot;&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=&quot;name&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;type&lt;/item&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=&quot;value&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;font/woff2&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=&quot;crossorigin&quot; xsi:type=&quot;array&quot;&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=&quot;name&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;crossorigin&lt;/item&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=&quot;value&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot;&gt;false&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;/item&gt;\n                &lt;/item&gt;\n                ...\n            &lt;/argument&gt;\n        &lt;/arguments&gt;\n    &lt;/referenceBlock&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>...\n&lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;referenceBlock name=\"head.asset.preload\"&gt;\n        &lt;arguments&gt;\n            &lt;argument name=\"assets\" xsi:type=\"array\"&gt;\n                &lt;item name=\"uikit-icons\" xsi:type=\"array\"&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=\"path\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;js/uikit/uikit-icons.min.js&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=\"type\" xsi:type=\"array\"&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=\"name\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;type&lt;/item&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=\"value\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;script&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=\"crossorigin\" xsi:type=\"array\"&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=\"name\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;crossorigin&lt;/item&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=\"value\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;false&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;/item&gt;\n                &lt;/item&gt;\n                &lt;item name=\"montserrat-light\" xsi:type=\"array\"&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=\"path\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;fonts/Montserrat/Montserrat-Light.woff2&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=\"type\" xsi:type=\"array\"&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=\"name\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;type&lt;/item&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=\"value\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;font/woff2&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;item name=\"crossorigin\" xsi:type=\"array\"&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=\"name\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;crossorigin&lt;/item&gt;\n                        &lt;item name=\"value\" xsi:type=\"string\"&gt;false&lt;/item&gt;\n                    &lt;/item&gt;\n                &lt;/item&gt;\n                ...\n            &lt;/argument&gt;\n        &lt;/arguments&gt;\n    &lt;/referenceBlock&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">UIkit CSS classes safelist</h3><a id=\"user-content-uikit-css-classes-safelist\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: UIkit CSS classes safelist\" href=\"#uikit-css-classes-safelist\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To compile UIkit css classes inside the css files you need to specify file paths to scan into uikit_whitelist.xml files:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;config xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot; xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=&quot;urn:magento:module:MageOS_UIkitTheme:etc/uikit_whitelist.xsd&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;paths&gt;\n        &lt;path name=&quot;mage-os_app&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot; &gt;app/design/frontend/Mage-OS/UIkit&lt;/path&gt;\n        &lt;path name=&quot;mage-os_vendor&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot; &gt;vendor/mage-os/theme-frontend-uikit&lt;/path&gt;\n    &lt;/paths&gt;\n&lt;/config&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\"?&gt;\n&lt;config xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=\"urn:magento:module:MageOS_UIkitTheme:etc/uikit_whitelist.xsd\"&gt;\n    &lt;paths&gt;\n        &lt;path name=\"mage-os_app\" xsi:type=\"string\" &gt;app/design/frontend/Mage-OS/UIkit&lt;/path&gt;\n        &lt;path name=\"mage-os_vendor\" xsi:type=\"string\" &gt;vendor/mage-os/theme-frontend-uikit&lt;/path&gt;\n    &lt;/paths&gt;\n&lt;/config&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Or compile a safelist of classes if any phtml/html/xml file expose them</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;config xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot; xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=&quot;urn:magento:module:MageOS_UIkitTheme:etc/uikit_whitelist.xsd&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;terms&gt;\n        &lt;term name=&quot;button&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot; &gt;uk-button&lt;/term&gt;\n        &lt;term name=&quot;button-primary&quot; xsi:type=&quot;string&quot; &gt;uk-button-primary&lt;/term&gt;\n    &lt;/terms&gt;\n&lt;/config&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\"?&gt;\n&lt;config xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=\"urn:magento:module:MageOS_UIkitTheme:etc/uikit_whitelist.xsd\"&gt;\n    &lt;terms&gt;\n        &lt;term name=\"button\" xsi:type=\"string\" &gt;uk-button&lt;/term&gt;\n        &lt;term name=\"button-primary\" xsi:type=\"string\" &gt;uk-button-primary&lt;/term&gt;\n    &lt;/terms&gt;\n&lt;/config&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Installation</h2><a id=\"user-content-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Install it into your Mage-OS/Magento 2 project with composer:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"composer require mage-os/module-theme-uikit\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>composer require mage-os/module-theme-uikit\n</code></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"2\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Enable module</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"bin/magento setup:upgrade\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>bin/magento setup:upgrade\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Make sure to also install <a href=\"https://github.com/mage-os-lab/theme-frontend-uikit\">mage-os-lab/theme-frontend-uikit</a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Changelog</h2><a id=\"user-content-changelog\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Changelog\" href=\"#changelog\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Please see <a href=\"CHANGELOG.md\">CHANGELOG</a> for more information on what has changed recently.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The MIT License (MIT). Please see <a href=\"LICENSE\">License File</a> for more information.</p>\n</article></div>"
